    "tpb_book": "<div>1.自編講義</div>\n\n<div>2.精密工具機技術, 張堅浚, 全華</div>\n\n<div>3.機械製造Manufacturing Engineering and Technology,&nbsp;Serope Kalpakjian,&nbsp;文京圖書有限公司</div>\n",
